{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1448.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"7925f88da9c131c3c6d92a1a57de20af242632079aaa8dac83749a289115c140","ja":"紗代子のイメージ","zh":"纱代子的印象","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1448.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e5c8d300ad83f625a6c84244b7c0092bd3e329fbd8b6468d4c2e4739d634f28d","ja":"お仕事が終わって、劇場に戻る途中で……","zh":"工作结束后，在回剧场的路上……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1448.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ebca6af35d6d02f6759698805b3790f75233cc14e5160b817f957d9b6a988831","ja":"この後は、夜までレッスンだよな！\nよーし、気合入れて……。","zh":"接下来要一直训练到晚上了吧！\n好——要打起精神来……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1448.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f6842c8761b18ac38758c0f1c9752e0a3cd1eef7d698923de07a66f0236afe90","ja":"「すみません、昴ちゃんと……た、高山さんですよね？\nこの間の公演を見て、ファンになりました！」","zh":"“请问，是昴还有……高、高山小姐对吧？\n看了前阵子的公演之后，我就成为你们的粉丝了！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1448.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"7755886cfe56fef812d886818b6a92b85204806da6d4ebfad117e996538e9a64","ja":"そうなんだ！？　へへっ、サンキューな！","zh":"是这样吗！？嘿嘿，谢啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1448.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"5124d9f770ea165828441cdfc11cf28eeb0bcb36ee2f3759c97429faa03fb93f","ja":"「はい！　これからも応援してます、昴ちゃん！\nそ、その、高山さんも……」","zh":"「好的！我今后也会继续为你加油的，昂！\n还、还有，高山小姐也是……」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1448.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"131eb31ae7484729e312be09e5498e1e2cd9010f0abe1c4620abbef8fe60cd90","ja":"あっ、はい。ありがとうございます！","zh":"啊，好的。非常感谢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1448.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"cf38da75843fde8113c3a374d1b80147ec00c6619979b8dc47f6786068eec500","ja":"（……あれっ？\nなんかこの人、紗代子に怯えてないか……？）","zh":"（……咦？\n这个人怎么好像有点怕纱代子……？）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1448.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"1c899c86720cbe3193682af79ae11dcebd2d822908e8da5c29ea5a824ee68d87","ja":"まぁ、そんなことがありましたの。","zh":"哎呀，原来还有这样的事啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1448.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"3e2b672bd48abfd1af8df25ccd609b759b265deaff056dfbdbbd9bf159d046d6","ja":"この前の公演でファンになってくれた人なら、\n藍さんのイメージが強いのかもしれませんね……。","zh":"要是上一场公演才粉上我的人，\n可能对蓝的印象会更深刻吧……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1448.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"6a29e4afbd60abce97976b11c85e0896a9e667e8d3764948d897f5eb6bded002","ja":"ドラマや劇から入ってきてくれた人だと、\nギャップを感じることもあるみたいですし。","zh":"如果是通过电视剧或舞台剧认识我们的人，\n好像有时也会感受到反差呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1448.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"fb6d7825871dff580043a7c430efe9cdd97e03c703f456b9b728e3b375ca8915","ja":"ありさは、アイドルちゃんのギャップも\n大好物なんですけど！　……むふふ～♪","zh":"亚利沙最喜欢偶像的反差萌了！\n……嘿嘿嘿～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1448.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"91a48af5492c37117619de3c8a3ecf1402850a0353557425928757b341efd981","ja":"じ、じゃあ……紗代子さんが、怖い人だと\n思われちゃってるんでしょうか……？","zh":"那、那么……大家会觉得纱代子是个\n可怕的人吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1448.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"619c1f76710ac7cabc8c1d654d8901d05733c5e61a4faa3d831915da12097beb","ja":"藍は、怖い人じゃないけど……性格が\nきつく見えちゃうのは、仕方がないかな……。","zh":"蓝并不是个可怕的人，只是……\n性格看起来有些强势，这也是没办法的事吧……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1448.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"320b7598c7e77e676a0ab15e66f08f545da4da212c02cd8a51df4303942763ed","ja":"でも、私が藍に見えるってことは、私のお芝居が\n上手くできてたってことだと思うから……うん。","zh":"不过，既然大家觉得我看起来像蓝，就说明我的戏\n演得很成功吧……嗯。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1448.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"6a44487b6e4a551ae8e5d88a3d115a8ea588393ffc6a0c601c56398b7bc7d5ec","ja":"（うーん……そうは言ってても、\nショックを受けてるみたいなんだよな……それなら！）","zh":"（唔……虽说是这么说，\n但好像还是受了打击啊……既然这样！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
